            "review_title": "Review at Wasabi - Nha Hang Ly Ba",
            "review_text": "DNolan2000\nPhoenix, Arizona6 contributions\n0\nRecommended by a local\nFeb 2017\nThe sushi was quite good and fresh. I ordered a sashimi platter and was happy with everything, though i didn't know what everything was. The servers were nice and quick, though we were one of the last tables to come in. We were brought up to the 2nd floor and had a nice little table. The only drawback were the other patrons smoking. Coming from the States where most restaurants have no-smoking in the dining rooms this was a challenge. Not Wasabi's fault, just another cultural difference that pops up unexpectedly. We dealt with it, and enjoyed the food.\nRead more\nWritten March 11, 2017",
