            "review_text": "Duke of Admiralty\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nCosy Japanese diner.\nSep 2016 • Friends\nImpromptu sashimi dinner with colleagues. \n\nI must say this is an unplanned drop in with pleasant dining experience. \n\nCosy and friendly with service staff who are fluent in Japanese too! \n\nLooking at the flow of native Japanese clients, this is a safe bet for any fresh sashimi and almost-just-like-home Japanese food.\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2016",
